msgid "Send to Back"
msgstr "Prebaci nazad"

#: kwview.cc:488
msgid "Text Mode"
msgstr "Tekstualni mod"

#: kwview.cc:491
msgid "Only show the text of the document."
msgstr "Prikaži samo tekst dokumenta."

#: kwview.cc:492
msgid ""
"Do not show any pictures, formatting or layout. KWord will display only the "
"text for editing."
msgstr ""
"Ne pokazuje slike, formatiranje ili izgled. KWord će prikazati samo tekst "
"za editovanje."

#: kwview.cc:495
msgid "&Page Mode"
msgstr "&Stranični mod"

#: kwview.cc:498
msgid ""
"Switch to page mode."
"<br>"
"<br> Page mode is designed to make editing your text easy."
"<br>"
"<br>This function is most frequently used to return to text editing after "
"switching to Preview mode."
msgstr ""
"Prebaci na stranični mod."
"<br>"
"<br> Stranični mod je napravljen kako bi vam olakšao editovanje "
"teksta."
"<br>"
"<br>Ova funkcija se najčešće koristi za povratak na editovanje teksta "
"nakon što ste vidjeli Pregled."

#: kwview.cc:499
msgid "Switch to page editing mode."
msgstr "Prebacuje na mod za editovanje stranice."

#: kwview.cc:503
msgid "Pre&view Mode"
msgstr "&Pregled"

#: kwview.cc:506
msgid ""
"Zoom out from your document to get a look at several pages of your "
"document.<br><br>The number of pages per line can be customized."
msgstr ""
"Umanjuje vaš dokument kako biste vidjeli više stranica "
"istovremeno.<br><br>Broj stranica u jednom redu se može izmijeniti."

#: kwview.cc:507
msgid "Zoom out to a multiple page view."
msgstr "Pogled na više stranica istovremeno."

#: kwview.cc:511
msgid "&Formatting Characters"
msgstr "&Znakovi za formatiranje"

#: kwview.cc:514
msgid "Toggle the display of non-printing characters."
msgstr "Prekidač prikazivanja znakova koji se ne štampaju."

#: kwview.cc:515
msgid ""
"Toggle the display of non-printing characters."
"<br>"
"<br>"
"When this is enabled, KWord shows you tabs, spaces, carriage returns and "
"other non-printing characters."
msgstr ""
"Prekidač prikazivanja znakova koji se ne štampaju."
"<br>"
"<br>Kada je ovo uključeno, KWord će vam prikazati tabove, razmake, nove "
"redove i ostale znakove koji se neće štampati."

#: kwview.cc:517
msgid "Frame &Borders"
msgstr "&Rubovi okvira"

#: kwview.cc:520
msgid "Turns the border display on and off."
msgstr "Prekidač za prikazivanje ruba okvira."

#: kwview.cc:521
msgid ""
"Turns the border display on and off."
"<br>"
"<br>The borders are never printed. This option is useful to see how the "
"document will appear on the printed page."
msgstr ""
"Prekidač za prikazivanje ruba okvira."
"<br>"
"<br>Rubovi se nikada ne štampaju. Ova opcija je korisna da biste vidjeli "
"kako će dokument izgledati kada se odštampa."

#: kwview.cc:523
msgid "Show &Header"
msgstr "Pokaži &zaglavlje"

#: kwview.cc:526
msgid "Shows and hides header display."
msgstr "Pokazuje i sakriva zaglavlje."

#: kwview.cc:527
msgid ""
"Selecting this option toggles the display of headers in "
"KWord."
"<br>"
"<br>Headers are special frames at the top of each page which can contain "
"page numbers or other information."
msgstr ""
"Izborom ove opcije prebacujete prikazivanje zaglavlja u "
"KWordu."
"<br>"
"<br>Zaglavlja su posebni okvirovi na vrhu svake stranice koji mogu "
"sadržavati broj stranice i druge informacije."

#: kwview.cc:529
msgid "Show Foo&ter"
msgstr "Pokaži p&odnožje"

#: kwview.cc:532
msgid "Shows and hides footer display."
msgstr "Pokazuje i sakriva podnožje."

#: kwview.cc:533
msgid ""
"Selecting this option toggles the display of footers in KWord. "
"<br>"
"<br>Footers are special frames at the bottom of each page which can contain "
"page numbers or other information."
msgstr ""
"Izborom ove opcije prebacujete prikazivanje podnožje u "
"KWordu."
"<br>"
"<br>Podnožja su posebni okvirovi na dnu svake stranice koji mogu "
"sadržavati broj stranice i druge informacije."

#: kwview.cc:544
msgid "Sp&ecial Character..."
msgstr "&Poseban znak..."

#: kwview.cc:548 kwview.cc:549
msgid "Insert one or more symbols or letters not found on the keyboard."
msgstr "Ubacuje jedan ili više simbola ili slova kojih nema na tastaturi."

#: kwview.cc:555
msgid "Page Break"
msgstr "Prelom Stranice"

#: kwview.cc:556
msgid "Force the remainder of the text into the next page."
msgstr "Prisiljava prelazak ostatka teksta u sljedeću stranicu."

#: kwview.cc:557
msgid ""
"This inserts a non-printing character at the current cursor position. All "
"text after this point will be moved into the next page."
msgstr ""
"Ovo ubacuje poseban znak koji se ne štampa na lokaciju kursora. On "
"označava da se sav tekst nakon njega prebacuje u sljedeću stranicu."

#: kwview.cc:559
msgid "&Hard Frame Break"
msgstr "&Tvrdi prekid okvira"

#: kwview.cc:560
msgid "Force the remainder of the text into the next frame."
msgstr "Prisiljava prelazak ostatka teksta u idući okvir."

#: kwview.cc:561
msgid ""
"This inserts a non-printing character at the current cursor position. All "
"text after this point will be moved into the next frame in the frameset."
msgstr ""
"Ovo ubacuje poseban znak koji se ne štampa na lokaciju kursora. On "
"označava da se sav tekst nakon njega prebacuje u idući okvir u frameset-u."

#: kwview.cc:564
msgid "Page..."
msgstr "Stranica..."

#: kwview.cc:568
msgid "Link..."
msgstr "Link..."

#: kwview.cc:571 kwview.cc:572
msgid "Insert a web address, email address or hyperlink to a file."
msgstr "Ubacuje web adresu, email adresu ili hiperlink u datoteku."

#: kwview.cc:574
msgid "Comment..."
msgstr "Komentar..."

#: kwview.cc:577
msgid "Insert a comment about the selected text."
msgstr "Ubacuje komentar o izabranom tekstu."

#: kwview.cc:578
msgid ""
"Insert a comment about the selected text. These comments are not designed to "
"appear on the final page."
msgstr ""
"Ubacuje komentar o izabranom tekstu. Ovi komentari se neće vidjeti na "
"stranici kada ona bude odštampana."

#: kwview.cc:580
msgid "Edit Comment..."
msgstr "Izmijeni komentar..."

#: kwview.cc:583 kwview.cc:584
msgid "Change the content of a comment."
msgstr "Mijenja sadržaj komentara."

#: kwview.cc:586
msgid "Remove Comment"
msgstr "Ukloni komentar"

#: kwview.cc:589 kwview.cc:590
msgid "Remove the selected document comment."
msgstr "Briše izabrani komentar iz dokumenta."

#: kwview.cc:591
msgid "Copy Text Of Comment..."
msgstr "Kopiraj tekst komentara..."

#: kwview.cc:596
msgid "&Footnote/Endnote..."
msgstr "&Fusnota/Krajnjanota..."

#: kwview.cc:599 kwview.cc:600
msgid "Insert a footnote referencing the selected text."
msgstr "Dodaje fusnotu vezanu za izabrani tekst."

#: kwview.cc:602 kwview.cc:3326
msgid "Table of &Contents"
msgstr "Tablica &sadržaja"

#: kwview.cc:605 kwview.cc:606
msgid "Insert table of contents at the current cursor position."
msgstr "Ubacuje sadržaj na trenutni položaj kursora."

#: kwview.cc:609
msgid "&Variable"
msgstr "&Varijabla"

#: kwview.cc:613
msgid "Document &Information"
msgstr "&Informacije o dokumentu"

#: kwview.cc:614
msgid "&Date"
msgstr "&Datum"

#: kwview.cc:615
msgid "&Time"
msgstr "&Vrijeme"

#: kwview.cc:616
msgid "&Page"
msgstr "&Stranica"

#: kwview.cc:618 kwview.cc:1393
msgid "&Custom"
msgstr "&Vlastito"

#: kwview.cc:627
msgid "&Refresh All Variables"
msgstr "&Osvježi sve varijable"

#: kwview.cc:630
msgid "Update all variables to current values."
msgstr "Postavlja sve varijable na aktuelne vrijednosti."

#: kwview.cc:631
msgid ""
"Update all variables in the document to current values."
"<br>"
"<br>This will update page numbers, dates or any other variables that need "
"updating."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja sve varijable u dokumentu na njihove aktuelne "
"vrijednosti."
"<br>"
"<br>Ovo znači ispravljanje brojeva stranica, datuma ili nekih drugih "
"varijabli čiju vrijednost treba uskladiti sa aktuelnim stanjem."

#: kwview.cc:635
msgid "&Expression"
msgstr "&Izraz"

#: kwview.cc:639
msgid "Te&xt Frame"
msgstr "&Tekstualni okvir"

#: kwview.cc:642 kwview.cc:643
msgid "Create a new text frame."
msgstr "Napravi novi tekstualni okvir."

#: kwview.cc:646
msgid "For&mula"
msgstr "For&mula"

#: kwview.cc:649 kwview.cc:650
msgid "Insert a formula into a new frame."
msgstr "Ubaci formulu u novi okvir."

#: kwview.cc:652
msgid "&Table..."
msgstr "&Tabela..."

#: kwview.cc:656
msgid "Create a table."
msgstr "Napravi tabelu."

#: kwview.cc:657
msgid ""
"Create a table."
"<br><br>The table can either exist in a frame of its own or inline."
msgstr ""
"Napravi tabelu."
"<br><br>Ova tabela se može nalaziti u okviru ili zasebno, u liniji."

#: kwview.cc:659
msgid "P&icture..."
msgstr "&Slika..."

#: kwview.cc:663
msgid "Create a new frame for a picture."
msgstr "Napravi novi okvir za sliku."

#: kwview.cc:664
msgid "Create a new frame for a picture or diagram."
msgstr "Pravi novi okvir za sliku ili dijagram."

#: kwview.cc:667
msgid "&Object Frame"
msgstr "&Objektni okvir"

#: kwview.cc:670 kwview.cc:671
msgid "Insert an object into a new frame."
msgstr "Umetni objekat u novi okvir."

#: kwview.cc:673
msgid "Fi&le..."
msgstr "&Datoteka..."

#: kwview.cc:679
msgid "&Font..."
msgstr "&Font..."

#: kwview.cc:682
msgid "Change character size, font, boldface, italics, etc."
msgstr "Promijeni veličinu slova, font, debljinu, zakošenost itd."

#: kwview.cc:683
msgid "Change the attributes of the currently selected characters."
msgstr "Promijeni atribute trenutno izabranih znakova."

#: kwview.cc:685
msgid "&Paragraph..."
msgstr "&Odlomak..."

#: kwview.cc:688
msgid "Change paragraph margins, text flow, borders, bullets, numbering, etc."
msgstr "Promijeni margine odlomka, tok teksta, rubove, nabrajanja itd."

#: kwview.cc:689
msgid ""
"Change paragraph margins, text flow, borders, bullets, numbering, "
"etc."
"<p>Select text in multiple paragraphs to change the formatting of all "
"selected paragraphs."
"<p>"
"If no text is selected, the paragraph where the cursor is located will be "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Mijenja margine odlomka, tok teksta, rubove, nabrajanja itd."
"<p>"
"Izaberite tekst u nekoliko odlomaka da biste izmijenili formatiranje svih "
"tih odlomaka."
"<p>Ako nije izabran tekst, biće izmijenjen odlomak u kojem se trenutno "
"nalazi kursor."

#: kwview.cc:691
msgid "F&rame/Frameset Properties..."
msgstr "&Okvir/Frameset Postavke..."

#: kwview.cc:694
msgid "Alter frameset properties."
msgstr "Izmijeni osobine frameseta."

#: kwview.cc:695
msgid "Alter frameset properties.<p>Currently you can change the frame background."
msgstr "Izmijeni osobine frameseta.<p>Trenutno možete izmijeniti pozadinu okvira."

#: kwview.cc:697
msgid "Page &Layout..."
msgstr "&Izgled Stranice..."

#: kwview.cc:700
msgid "Change properties of entire page."
msgstr "Izmijeni svojstva cijele stranice."

#: kwview.cc:701
msgid ""
"Change properties of the entire page."
"<p>"
"Currently you can change paper size, paper orientation, header and footer "
"sizes, and column settings."
msgstr ""
"Izmijeni svojstva cijele stranice."
"<p>Trenutno možete mijenjati dimenzije papira, orijentaciju, veličinu "
"zaglavlja i podnožja i postavke kolona."

#: kwview.cc:704
msgid "&Frame Style Manager"
msgstr "&Upravitelj stila okvira"

#: kwview.cc:707
msgid "Change attributes of framestyles."
msgstr "Izmijeni atribute stila okvira."

#: kwview.cc:708
msgid ""
"Change background and borders of framestyles."
"<p>Multiple framestyles can be changed using the dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Izmijeni pozadinu i rubove stila okvira."
"<p>Koristeći ovaj dijalog možete promijeniti više stilova."

#: kwview.cc:711
msgid "&Style Manager"
msgstr "&Upravitelj Stilova"

#: kwview.cc:714
msgid "Change attributes of styles."
msgstr "Izmijeni atribute stilova."

#: kwview.cc:715
msgid ""
"Change font and paragraph attributes of styles."
"<p>Multiple styles can be changed using the dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Izmijeni atribute fonta i odlomka za stilove."
"<p>Koristeći ovaj dijalog možete izmijeniti više stilova."

#: kwview.cc:722
msgid "Increase Font Size"
msgstr "Povećaj font"

#: kwview.cc:723
msgid "Decrease Font Size"
msgstr "Smanji font"

#: kwview.cc:725
msgid "Font Family"
msgstr "Familija fontova"

#: kwview.cc:730 kwview.cc:732
msgid "St&yle"
msgstr "&Stil"

#: kwview.cc:740 kwview.cc:4855
msgid "Default Format"
msgstr "Podrazumjevani format"

#: kwview.cc:743 kwview.cc:744
msgid "Change font and paragraph attributes to their default values."
msgstr "Vrati atribute fonta i odlomka na njihove podrazumjevane vrijednosti."

#: kwview.cc:748
msgid "&Bold"
msgstr "&Masno"

#: kwview.cc:751
msgid "&Italic"
msgstr "&Kurziv"

#: kwview.cc:754
msgid "&Underline"
msgstr "&Podvučeno"

#: kwview.cc:757
msgid "&Strike Out"
msgstr "&Precrtano"

#: kwview.cc:761
msgid "Align &Left"
msgstr "&Lijevo poravnato"

#: kwview.cc:766
msgid "Align &Center"
msgstr "&Centrirano"

#: kwview.cc:770
msgid "Align &Right"
msgstr "&Desno poravnato"

#: kwview.cc:774
msgid "Align &Block"
msgstr "&Blok poravnato"

#: kwview.cc:779
msgid "Superscript"
msgstr "Eksponent"

#: kwview.cc:783
msgid "Subscript"
msgstr "Indeks"

#: kwview.cc:788
msgid "Increase Indent"
msgstr "Uvuci"

#: kwview.cc:793
msgid "Decrease Indent"
msgstr "Izvuci"

#: kwview.cc:798
msgid "Text Color..."
msgstr "Boja teksta..."

#: kwview.cc:809
msgid "Number"
msgstr "Broj"

#: kwview.cc:812
msgid "Bullet"
msgstr "Tačka"

#: kwview.cc:837
msgid "Fra&mestyle"
msgstr "&Stil okvira"

#: kwview.cc:839
msgid "Framest&yle"
msgstr "Stil &okvira"

#: kwview.cc:844
msgid "Border Outline"
msgstr "Linija ruba"

#: kwview.cc:846
msgid "Border Left"
msgstr "Lijevi rub"

#: kwview.cc:848
msgid "Border Right"
msgstr "Desni rub"

#: kwview.cc:850
msgid "Border Top"
msgstr "Gornji rub"

#: kwview.cc:852
msgid "Border Bottom"
msgstr "Donji rub"

#: kwview.cc:854
msgid "Border Style"
msgstr "Stil ruba"

#: kwview.cc:867
msgid "Border Width"
msgstr "Širina ruba"

#: kwview.cc:876
msgid "Border Color"
msgstr "Boja ruba"

#: kwview.cc:881 kwview.cc:1801
msgid "Text Background Color..."
msgstr "Boja pozadine teksta..."

#: kwview.cc:882 kwview.cc:883
msgid "Change background color for currently selected text."
msgstr "Promijeni boju u pozadini trenutno izabranog teksta."

#: kwview.cc:892 kwview.cc:893
msgid "Adjust properties of the current table."
msgstr "Izmijeni postavke trenutne tabele."

#: kwview.cc:904
msgid "&Insert Row..."
msgstr "&Umetni red..."

#: kwview.cc:907
msgid "Insert one or more rows at cursor location."
msgstr "Umetni jedan ili više redova na lokaciji kursora."

#: kwview.cc:908
msgid "Insert one or more rows at current cursor location."
msgstr "Umetni jedan ili više redova na trenutnoj lokaciji kursora."

#: kwview.cc:910
msgid "I&nsert Column..."
msgstr "U&metni kolonu..."

#: kwview.cc:913 kwview.cc:914
msgid "Insert one or more columns into the current table."
msgstr "Umetni jednu ili više kolona u trenutnu tabelu."

#: kwview.cc:916
msgid "&Delete Selected Rows..."
msgstr "O&briši izabrane redove..."

#: kwview.cc:919 kwview.cc:920
msgid "Delete selected rows from the current table."
msgstr "Obriši izabrane redove iz tabele."

#: kwview.cc:922
msgid "D&elete Selected Columns..."
msgstr "&Obriši izabrane kolone..."

#: kwview.cc:925
msgid "Delete selected columns from the current table."
msgstr "Obriši izabrane kolone iz tabele."

#: kwview.cc:926
msgid "Delete selected column from the current table."
msgstr "Obriši izabranu kolonu iz tabele."

#: kwview.cc:928
msgid "Resize Column..."
msgstr "Širina kolone..."

#: kwview.cc:931 kwview.cc:932
msgid "Change the width of the currently selected column."
msgstr "Promijeni širinu trenutno izabrane kolone."

#: kwview.cc:935
msgid "&Join Cells"
msgstr "S&poji polja"

#: kwview.cc:938
msgid "Join two or more cells into one large cell."
msgstr "Spoji dva ili više polja tabele u jedno veće polje."

#: kwview.cc:939
msgid ""
"Join two or more cells into one large cell."
"<p>This is a good way to create titles and labels within a table."
msgstr ""
"Spoji dva ili više polja tabele u jedno veće polje."
"<p>Ovo je dobar način za pravljenje naslova ili oznaka u tabeli."

#: kwview.cc:941
msgid "&Split Cells..."
msgstr "&Razdvoji polja..."

#: kwview.cc:944
msgid "Split one cell into two or more cells."
msgstr "Razdvoji jedno polje na dva ili više polja."

#: kwview.cc:945
msgid ""
"Split one cell into two or more cells."
"<p>Cells can be split horizontally, vertically or both directions at once."
msgstr ""
"Razdvoji jedno polje na dva ili više polja."
"<p>Polja mogu biti razdvojena vodoravno, uspravno ili u oba pravca "
"istovremeno."

#: kwview.cc:947
msgid "Protect Cells"
msgstr "Zaštiti polja"

#: kwview.cc:950
msgid "Prevent changes to content of selected cells."
msgstr "Onemogući izmjene u sadržaju izabranih polja."

#: kwview.cc:951
msgid ""
"Toggles cell protection on and off."
"<br>"
"<br>When cell protection is on, the user can not alter the content or "
"formatting of the text within the cell."
msgstr ""
"Prekidač za zaštitu polja."
"<br>"
"<br>Kada je zaštita polja uključena, korisnik ne može mijenjati sadržaj "
"ili formatiranje teksta unutar polja."

#: kwview.cc:953
msgid "&Ungroup Table"
msgstr "R&azgrupiraj tabelu"

#: kwview.cc:956
msgid "Break a table into individual frames."
msgstr "Razbij tabelu u više zasebnih okvira."

#: kwview.cc:957
msgid ""
"Break a table into individual frames"
"<p>Each frame can be moved independently around the page."
msgstr ""
"Razbij tabelu u više zasebnih okvira."
"<p>Svaki okvir možete zasebno pomjerati po stranici."

#: kwview.cc:959
msgid "Delete &Table"
msgstr "Obriši &tabelu"

#: kwview.cc:962
msgid "Delete the entire table."
msgstr "Obriši cijelu tabelu."

#: kwview.cc:963
msgid ""
"Deletes all cells and the content within the cells of the currently selected "
"table."
msgstr "Briše sva polja kao i njihov sadržaj u trenutno izabranoj tabeli."

#: kwview.cc:966
msgid "T&able Style Manager"
msgstr "Upravitelj stila t&abele"

#: kwview.cc:969
msgid "Change attributes of tablestyles."
msgstr "Izmijeni atribute stilova tabela."

#: kwview.cc:970
msgid ""
"Change textstyle and framestyle of the tablestyles."
"<p>Multiple tablestyles can be changed using the dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Izmijeni stil teksta i stil okvira unutar stila tabele."
"<p>Ovim dijalogom možete izmijeniti više stilova tabele."

#: kwview.cc:972 kwview.cc:974
msgid "Table&style"
msgstr "&Stil tabele"

#: kwview.cc:980
msgid "Convert Table to Text"
msgstr "Konvertuj Tabelu u Tekst"

#: kwview.cc:983 sortdia.cc:31
msgid "Sort Text"
msgstr "Sortiraj tekst"

#: kwview.cc:987
msgid "Add Expression"
msgstr "Dodaj Izraz"

#: kwview.cc:995
msgid "Enable Autocorrection"
msgstr "Uključi ispravljanje"

#: kwview.cc:998 kwview.cc:999
msgid "Toggle autocorrection on and off."
msgstr "Prekidač za automatsko ispravljanje."

#: kwview.cc:1001
msgid "Configure &Autocorrection..."
msgstr "Podesi &ispravljanje..."

#: kwview.cc:1004
msgid "Change autocorrection options."
msgstr "Izmijeni opcije automatskog ispravljanja."

#: kwview.cc:1005
msgid ""
"Change autocorrection options including:"
"<p> "
"<UL>"
"<LI>"
"<P>exceptions to autocorrection</P> "
"<LI>"
"<P>add/remove autocorrection replacement text</P> "
"<LI><P>and basic autocorrection options</P>."
msgstr ""
"Izmijeni opcije automatskog ispravljanja, uključujući:"
"<p> "
"<UL>"
"<LI>"
"<p>izuzeci od automatskog ispravljanja</P> "
"<LI>"
"<P>dodavanje/brisanje pravila za zamjenu kod ispravljanja</p> "
"<LI><P>osnovne opcije ispravljanja</P>."

#: kwview.cc:1007
msgid "Custom &Variables..."
msgstr "&Vlastite varijable..."

#: kwview.cc:1011
msgid "Edit &Personal Expressions..."
msgstr "Izmijeni &Lične Izraze..."

#: kwview.cc:1014
msgid "Add or change one or more personal expressions."
msgstr "Dodaj ili izmijeni jedan ili više ličnih izraza."

#: kwview.cc:1015
msgid ""
"Add or change one or more personal expressions."
"<p>"
"Personal expressions are a way to quickly insert commonly used phrases or "
"text into your document."
msgstr ""
"Dodaj ili izmijeni jedan ili više ličnih izraza."
"<p>Lični izrazi su brz način za umetanje često korištenih fraza ili "
"teksta u vaš dokument."

#: kwview.cc:1017
msgid "Change Case..."
msgstr "Izmijeni velika/mala slova..."

#: kwview.cc:1020
msgid "Alter the capitalization of selected text."
msgstr "Promijeni kapitalizaciju izabranog teksta."

#: kwview.cc:1021
msgid ""
"Alter the capitalization of selected text to one of five pre-defined "
"patterns."
"<p>You can also switch all letters from uppercase to lower case and from "
"lower case to upper case in one move."
msgstr ""
"Promijeni kapitalizaciju izabranog teksta u jedan od pet predefinisanih "
"uzoraka."
